Package: scaleCorrection
Type: Package
Title: Research Companion for Optimism-Corrected Ridge Scaling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Mohammad", "Arashi", email = "mohammad.arashi@up.ac.za",
    role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Bahadir", "Yuzbasi", role = "aut"))
Description: Additive research implementation of nonnegative optimism-corrected
    scaling after soft thresholding of ridge coefficients. Reuses the frozen
    softridge preprocessing and ridge engine. New scaling and prediction-score
    kernels use RcppArmadillo. The plug-in correction is evaluated empirically;
    it does not claim unbiased risk for an adaptively tuned estimator.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: stats, Rcpp, softridge, glmnet, digest
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
Author: Mohammad Arashi [aut, cre], Bahadir Yuzbasi [aut]
Maintainer: Mohammad Arashi <mohammad.arashi@up.ac.za>
URL: https://byuzbasi.github.io/softridge/scaleCorrection/, https://github.com/byuzbasi/softridge
BugReports: https://github.com/byuzbasi/softridge/issues
